  "FriendlyName": "Unreal AI Mesh Terrain Water (Experimental)",
  "Description": "Experimental, UE 5.8+ only. RQL module for Water bodies on Unreal's experimental Mesh Terrain (Mesh Partition Water): create oceans, lakes and rivers that carve their bed into a Mesh Terrain, read their readiness and problems, size the water zone. An AI Game Developer (Unreal-MCP) extension: an IUnrealMcpRqlModule that agents use through rql-query / rql-mutate / rql-schema.",
  "Category": "AI",
  "CreatedBy": "Ivan Murzak",
  "CreatedByURL": "https://github.com/IvanMurzak/Unreal-MCP",
  "DocsURL": "https://github.com/IvanMurzak/Unreal-MCP/blob/main/docs/EXTENSIONS.md",
  "MarketplaceURL": "",
  "SupportURL": "https://github.com/IvanMurzak/Unreal-MCP/issues",
